    "long_instructions": "TODOs:\r\n* Ask the bot for some initial ideas for a social media page used by the 13 colonies.\r\n* Try to brainstorm ideas for colonial profile pictures or usernames.\r\n* Ask the bot what kind of trending topics or hashtags might have existed.\r\n* See if you can get ideas for specific posts related to historical events like the Boston Tea Party.\r\n* Challenge the bot to come up with ideas for advertising colonial products on social media.\r\n* Experiment with asking for ideas for different colonies, like Massachusetts or Virginia.",
